    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Waking Up in the Lie</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are R3D, an alien robot trapped in a strange simulation. You don\u2019t know who\u2019s pulling the strings\u2014or why\u2014but something feels off. Every move you make might lead you closer to the truth\u2026 or deeper into the deception.<br>How far are you willing to go to break free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a layered narrative and uncover the hidden motives of those around you. Pay close attention to conversations and search for secret notes\u2014they could hold crucial truths. Don\u2019t let yourself be misled; only the right choices will guide you to freedom when the time comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/cade1008c8c6d2b541ba75cccc914a8e.poster.avif?t=1748427195\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/cade1008c8c6d2b541ba75cccc914a8e.webm?t=1748427195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/cade1008c8c6d2b541ba75cccc914a8e.mp4?t=1748427195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Collapse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you manage to break the simulation? Then brace yourself\u2014now you\u2019ll have to face the General and fight your way out of the lab. New puzzle mechanics await, but this time you\u2019re not alone: turrets and enemies will be hunting you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/87621c1f7bca510352812678a4f5e43a.poster.avif?t=1748427195\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/87621c1f7bca510352812678a4f5e43a.webm?t=1748427195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/87621c1f7bca510352812678a4f5e43a.mp4?t=1748427195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted puzzles that challenge your logic and creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, twisting narrative\u2014who can you really trust?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden notes packed with vital information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action sequences that shift the pace and tone of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your choices</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Waking Up in the Lie</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are R3D, an alien robot trapped in a strange simulation. You don\u2019t know who\u2019s pulling the strings\u2014or why\u2014but something feels off. Every move you make might lead you closer to the truth\u2026 or deeper into the deception.<br>How far are you willing to go to break free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a layered narrative and uncover the hidden motives of those around you. Pay close attention to conversations and search for secret notes\u2014they could hold crucial truths. Don\u2019t let yourself be misled; only the right choices will guide you to freedom when the time comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/cade1008c8c6d2b541ba75cccc914a8e.poster.avif?t=1748427195\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/cade1008c8c6d2b541ba75cccc914a8e.webm?t=1748427195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/cade1008c8c6d2b541ba75cccc914a8e.mp4?t=1748427195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Collapse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you manage to break the simulation? Then brace yourself\u2014now you\u2019ll have to face the General and fight your way out of the lab. New puzzle mechanics await, but this time you\u2019re not alone: turrets and enemies will be hunting you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/87621c1f7bca510352812678a4f5e43a.poster.avif?t=1748427195\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/87621c1f7bca510352812678a4f5e43a.webm?t=1748427195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766330/extras/87621c1f7bca510352812678a4f5e43a.mp4?t=1748427195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted puzzles that challenge your logic and creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep, twisting narrative\u2014who can you really trust?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden notes packed with vital information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action sequences that shift the pace and tone of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your choices</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "What if your world was a lie? Outsmart inventive puzzles to escape the glitching simulation that holds you captive. Question reality and uncover a dark conspiracy while evading rogue security systems in this innovative puzzle-adventure.",
